     The eexxtt22ffss driver first appeared in FreeBSD 2.2.

AAUUTTHHOORRSS
     The eexxtt22ffss kernel implementation is derived from code written, or modi‐
     fied, by Godmar Back using the UFS CSRG sources for CMU Mach.

     John Dyson did the initial port to FreeBSD.  Aditya Sarawgi merged impor‐
     tant parts of the allocation code from a clean-room NetBSD implementa‐
     tion.  Zheng Liu and Fedor Uporov implemented the read and write support
     respectively for _e_x_t_4 filesystems.  The FreeBSD community has contributed
     a huge amount of modifications.

